@startuml

title Диаграмма развертывания - FastAPI LangGraph Agent Production Template

skinparam linetype ortho
skinparam {
    ArrowColor #555
    ArrowThickness 1.5
    ArrowFontColor #333
    RectangleBorderColor #2563eb
    RectangleFontColor #333
}
skinparam rectangle {
    StereotypeFontSize 8
    Shadowing <<node>> false
    Shadowing <<boundary>> false
}
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

node "DMZ" as dmz {
    [Nginx / Load Balancer\nReverse Proxy, Rate Limiting] as LB
}

node "Control Plane" as cp {
    [FastAPI Gateway\nAPI Gateway, Auth, Rate Limiting] as API
    [LangGraph Orchestrator\nPlan-Observe-Act, Agent Coordination] as ORCH
    [PostgreSQL\nAgent State, Sessions] as DB
}

node "Compute Plane" as compute {
    [vLLM\nQwen2.5-32B AWQ, KV-cache] as VLLM
    [LangChain Tools\nVector Search, Graph DB] as TOOLS
}

node "Data Plane" as data {
    [Qdrant\nVector DB, Embeddings] as VECTORDB
    [Neo4j\nGraph DB, Knowledge Graph] as GRAPHDB
}

node "Observability" as obs {
    [Langfuse\nLLM Tracing, Analytics] as LF
    [OpenTelemetry\nTraces, Metrics, Logs] as OTEL
    [Prometheus\nMetrics, GPU Usage] as PROM
    [Grafana\nDashboards, Alerts] as GRAF
}

node "Security" as sec {
    [HashiCorp Vault\nSecrets Management] as VAULT
}

LB --> API : HTTPS (TLS 1.3)
API --> ORCH : Sanitized Request
ORCH --> DB : State Persistence
API --> VAULT : Secrets (gRPC)

ORCH --> VLLM : LLM Inference
ORCH --> TOOLS : Tool Calls
TOOLS --> VECTORDB : Vector Search
TOOLS --> GRAPHDB : Graph Traversal

API --> OTEL : Traces + Metrics
ORCH --> OTEL : Agent Spans
VLLM --> OTEL : Inference Metrics
OTEL --> LF : LLM Traces
OTEL --> PROM : Metrics
PROM --> GRAF : Data Source

VAULT --> API : Dynamic Secrets
VAULT --> ORCH : DB Credentials
VAULT --> VLLM : Model API Keys

note right of ORCH
  **LangGraph Agents**:
  - Planner Agent
  - Retriever Agent
  - Analyst Agent
  - Security Guard Agent
  - Synthesizer Agent
  - Coordinator Agent
end note

note bottom of compute
  **Compute Resources**:
  - vLLM x2 (GPU)
  - LangChain Tools
  - Optimized for LLM workloads
end note

note bottom of data
  **Data Storage**:
  - Qdrant (Vector Search)
  - Neo4j (Graph DB)
  - RBAC enabled
end note

@enduml
